From: SWEET RMX1971 port (ZCode agent + AppleCampus)
Subject: [PATCH 0083] sweet: synchronous console-ring flush (sweet_log_flush_sync)

The periodic flush thread stops on its first UFS write error, taking
every later console anchor with it. Extract the ring-write loop into
sweet_log_write_span(), make the thread retry instead of stopping, and
expose sweet_log_flush_sync() for drivers that must not lose an anchor.

